    "In Finder, ⌘X copies the selection and marks it for moving, and ⌘V then moves it to the current folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Finder, ⌘X copies the selection and marks it for moving, and ⌘V then moves it to the current folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中，⌘X 会拷贝所选项目并标记为移动，随后按 ⌘V 即可移到当前文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Finder 中，⌘X 會拷貝所選項目並標記為移動，接著按 ⌘V 即可移到目前檔案夾。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finder では ⌘X で選択項目をコピーして移動待ちにし、⌘V で現在のフォルダに移動します。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Finder kopiert ⌘X die Auswahl und markiert sie zum Verschieben; ⌘V verschiebt sie dann in den aktuellen Ordner."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans le Finder, ⌘X copie la sélection et la marque pour un déplacement ; ⌘V la déplace ensuite dans le dossier courant."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En el Finder, ⌘X copia la selección y la marca para moverla; ⌘V la mueve después a la carpeta actual."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En el Finder, ⌘X copia la selección y la marca para moverla; luego ⌘V la mueve a la carpeta actual."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Finder, ⌘X copia a seleção e a marca para mover; ⌘V então a move para a pasta atual."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Finder, ⌘X copia a seleção e marca-a para mover; ⌘V move-a depois para a pasta atual."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nel Finder, ⌘X copia la selezione e la contrassegna per lo spostamento; ⌘V la sposta nella cartella corrente."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finder에서 ⌘X는 선택 항목을 복사하고 이동 대기 상태로 표시하며, ⌘V를 누르면 현재 폴더로 이동합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
